
### Deploy Service A v1
POST http://localhost:8080/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Service A",
  "version": 1
}

### Deploy Service B v1
POST http://localhost:8080/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Service B",
  "version": 1
}

### Upgrade Service A to v2
POST http://localhost:8080/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Service A",
  "version": 2
}

### Duplicate deployment
POST http://localhost:8080/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Service B",
  "version": 1
}

### Get services at system version 2
GET http://localhost:8080/services?systemVersion=2

### Get services at system version 3
GET http://localhost:8080/services?systemVersion=3

### Invalid deployment
POST http://localhost:8080/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "version": -1
}

### Unknown system version
GET http://localhost:8080/services?systemVersion=999
